# Purpose: Git attributes that keep text files on LF and mark binaries.
# Scope: LF normalisation for every text file, binary marking for images and fonts, and the lockfile
#   marked as generated so diffs and language stats skip it.
# Does NOT belong: Ignore rules (.gitignore) or editor settings (.editorconfig).
# Copyright (c) 2026 William Carson McRae. All rights reserved.
# SPDX-License-Identifier: LicenseRef-Daysforth-Restricted
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
package-lock.json linguist-generated=true
